  "_note": "steps: goto {url} (first) / click / fill {selector, text} / press {key} / wait {ms} / select {selector, value} / check / uncheck / hover / scroll_to {selector}. A dom predicate is text|value|visible|count|url|title|attribute (name) with equals, contains or matches; count also takes at_least; checked and enabled take no comparison. refer_image_assert compares the screen after the step with the user screenshot (reference_media_ref); tolerance is the visual score 0..100. This note is not part of the PATH."
